OL,3,GNEWSAPope prays with families of the
OL,4,ADisappeared during special audience
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has said a special prayer
OL,7,Fwith relatives of the Disappeared, in
OL,8,Fthe Vatican.
OL,10,FThe Disappeared are those who were
OL,11,Fabducted, murdered and secretly buried
OL,12,Fby republicans during Northern
OL,13,FIreland's Troubles.
OL,15,FDespite extensive and painstaking
OL,16,Fsearches, the bodies have never been
OL,17,Ffound of four out of 17 people listed
OL,18,Fby the commission set up to locate
OL,19,Fvictims' remains.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
